    "status": "present",
    "value": "You are given an n by n grid of 0s and 1s. In one move you may swap any two rows or any two columns. Return the fewest moves that turn the grid into a chessboard pattern, where no two orthogonally adjacent cells are equal, or -1 if that is impossible."
  },
